{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":46,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝與我們同在"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["可拉後裔的詩歌，交與伶長。調用女音。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝是我們的避難所，是我們的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我們在患難中隨時的幫助。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，地雖改變，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山雖搖動到海心，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的水雖匉訇翻騰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山雖因海漲而戰抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們也不害怕。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"有一道河，這河的分汊使上帝的城歡喜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這城就是至高者居住的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝在其中，城必不動搖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到天一亮，上帝必幫助這城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦喧嚷，列國動搖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝發聲，地便鎔化。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華與我們同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的上帝是我們的避難所！（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你們來看耶和華的作為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看他使地怎樣荒涼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他止息刀兵，直到地極；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他折弓、斷槍，把戰車焚燒在火中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要休息，要知道我是上帝！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在外邦中被尊崇，在遍地上也被尊崇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華與我們同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的上帝是我們的避難所！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}